{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is approached, take it and check properties. Otherwise, move closer or explore. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = ObjectPropertiesCheck    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ExploreArea    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />\"",
    "BT": {
